<title>USA: Varian to acquire remainder of Varian Korea.</title>
<headline>Varian to acquire remainder of Varian Korea.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, Calif. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Varian Associates Inc on Tuesday said it has reached an agreement to purchase the remaining 40 percent of its Korean semiconductor equipment joint venture, Varian Korea Ltd..</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were undisclosed.</p>
<p>Varian, which owns 60 percent of the company, is acquiring the remaining equity from S.K. Suh, Varian Korea's president and managing director.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to be completed in the next 30-60 days.</p>
</text>
